@liuhusk/dsh-status-card README · Behavior：When to show: permanent on a session page (rendered whenever a main session exists). Blocks render when
they have content; when everything is empty the body shows "No tasks or changes yet" — the card itself
stays. A turn's timing alone counts as content.

@liuhusk/dsh-status-card README · Install：Requires DSH 0.2.1-rc.3 or newer (the card is built against the `shell.overlay` seat and the session
controller of that line).

```bash

